  "goodToKnow": "Die Vererbung is heredity, the passing on of traits: die Mendelschen Regeln der Vererbung, worked out by Gregor Mendel with pea plants in the 1860s. It can also mean bequeathing property. Vererben means to pass on or bequeath; erben means to inherit, and das Erbe is an inheritance. Erblich means hereditary. Plural: die Vererbungen."
